:: Fishing Beach Wave
<<if $rng gte 80>>
	<<wetLower 120>>
	<<effects>>

	<<if $worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		A large wave rolls up the shore further than you expected, breaking cold around your bare legs.
	<<else>>
		A large wave rolls up the shore further than you expected, breaking around your legs and soaking your $worn.lower.name.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<wetAll>>
	<<effects>>

	A large wave surges up the beach and crashes over you before you can step back, drenching you completely.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
